  "description": "Every Sunday, Hongjoo and Chung play board games together. But the new Octopus Game Hongjoo brings turns out to be adults-only. Embarrassing missions pop out, but they are forced to keep playing, thanks to an old pact, and what starts as a game quickly turns dangerously personal.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12742057), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1561015345), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/octopus_game), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000071406), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250507) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[English](https://manta.net/en/series/the-octopus-game-full-ver?seriesId=4486)",
